### Create Company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Super Real Estate LLC"
}

### List Companies
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### Get Company
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Company
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Super Real Estate Global",
  "address": "Tashkent, Amir Temur 1"
}

### Get Company Config
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/config
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Company Config
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/config
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "dialWindowStart": "09:00:00",
  "dialWindowEnd": "20:00:00",
  "timezone": "Asia/Tashkent"
}

### Get Telephony Engine (platform admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/telephony-engine
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Telephony Engine (platform admin only)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/telephony-engine
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "telephonyEngine": "ASTERISK"
}

### Platform edit: name, status (ACTIVE / SUSPENDED = blocked / DELETED), expiry, call limit, features (SUPERADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/2/platform
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Ikkinchi kompaniya",
  "address": "Toshkent, Chilonzor",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "maxConcurrentCalls": 40,
  "disabledFeatures": ["ALERTING"],
  "disabledIntegrations": ["BITRIX24"]
}
